# Exo Free — findings by GLM 5.3 Flash

- Source: OpenCode Zen (`opencode/exo-free`, anonymous stealth route)
- Date: 2026-10-10 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

> SELF-EXCLUSION (per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md` / `tasks/research.md` Rule 9):
> zero verified public benchmark numbers (standardized harnesses: SWE-bench,
> GPQA, LiveCodeBench, AA Index, …) exist for this exact model/ID. Community
